<title>SWEDEN: Sweden sets auction of 7.5 bln Skr of T-bills.</title>
<headline>Sweden sets auction of 7.5 bln Skr of T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's National Debt Office said on Wednesday it would invite bids from the market for an auction of Treasury bills worth 7.5 billion crowns.</p>
<p>The auction will take place on June 11, it said and bids are due at 1030 GMT on that day. Settlement date is June 13.</p>
<p> Maturity date		Issue volume	    Number of days</p>
<p> Sept 17, 1997		500 million		    94</p>
